{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">李家鼎（鼎爺）在《在家宴客60道菜》中分享了惹味菜式「醬香骨」的食譜。這道菜選用肉質纖維細滑的豬一字排，成菜色澤胭紅且富光澤。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"58c7dbb4-664e-4cda-aad1-4a73e5f92465.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026KMKudh4Hxy1787564026.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"58c7dbb4-664e-4cda-aad1-4a73e5f92465.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6ca03d39-0b02-4446-a7fc-36973e9bda59.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026shmewOXYLa1787564026.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6ca03d39-0b02-4446-a7fc-36973e9bda59.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><strong>醬香骨食譜｜材料 </strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">一字腩排 2斤 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">甘筍1條 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">薑 數片 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">蔥 數段 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">唐芹 適量 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">蒜頭 4瓣 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">糖色比例： 水：冰糖＝ 1：3 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">調味料： </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">豆瓣醬 2湯匙 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">蠔油 1湯匙 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">米酒（玉冰燒）半杯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><strong>醬香骨食譜｜做法 </strong></span></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"64fab83e-489b-4bc6-872c-74e1b38638ce.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026e4aSCyzfuq1787564025.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"64fab83e-489b-4bc6-872c-74e1b38638ce.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>鼎爺烹調貼士</strong></p><